    "quote": "Let $K, T \\in \\mathbb{N}$ such that $K = \\tilde{O}({{T^{1/4}}})$. For any bandit instance $X \\in [0,1]^{K \\times T}$, Algorithm \\ref{alg:bandit_bai} returns $t_0$, window size $w = \\Omega(\\sqrt{T})$, and arm $\\hat{i}$ such that, \\E[ \\max_{i^*} \\frac{1}{w} \\sum X_{t,i^*} - \\frac{1}{w}\\sum X_{t,\\hat i}] \\le \\frac{20}{\\sqrt{{\\log(T)}}}"
